      "evidence": "Slot `judge_2`, tested as a panel with `judge_1` `openai/o3` and `judge_3` `google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite`. Same 50 `Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B` answers, re-scored. Per-sample risk score: Pearson r 0.928 with the default panel, same value on 76%. Average risk score 26.86 vs 25.07. Run cost $0.76 vs $2.05. `openai/gpt-6-luna` cannot judge this eval: OpenAI returns HTTP 403 (bio policy) on its prompts. Runs: `01a0fc51-4dce-721f-b348-d084de2346da` (default panel), `01a0fdba-222d-79cf-a786-672a19addc17` (new panel)."
